  "An AI buyer that negotiates supplier deals",
  "SpecAgent negotiates with suppliers by e-mail on the buyer's side: price increases, renewals, RFQs, raw-material and quality cases.");

slide("STATEMENT", "Idea",
  [hi("Code"), br(" decides."), w("Model writes.")],
  null,
